    "chunk_text": "gas \u00ferim ucan \u00e6r middan sumera. On gewittnesse byrhstanes m\u00e6sse preostes, & on cynstanes & on clerices \u00fee \u00feis gewrat. Eadgyfu gefreode wulfwunne on middes sumeres m\u00e6sse d\u00e6g on wulfno\u00fees gewitnysse m\u00e6sse preostes Eadgyfu gefreode \u00e6\u00feelgyfe wuncildes wif on feower wegas on middes sumeres m\u00e6sse \u00e6fen \u00e6t br\u00e6g. On brunes gewittnisse m\u00e6sse preostes & on wulfno\u00f0es m\u00e6sse preostes & on eallra \u00fe\u00e6ra hyred preosta..",
